@* The hover thumbnail, shared by the two faces that list a task's attachments — the task form's chips
   and the terminal rail's file rows. One component rather than the same block restated twice, because
   the `position: fixed` box, its sizing and the placement contract are all one decision.

   Its **parent element is the anchor**: `act-attach.place` positions this box against whatever it sits
   inside, so the caller only has to render it as a child of the row being hovered. *@
<div class="preview" id="@Id">
    <img src="@Url" alt="@Alt" />
</div>
